      'AI Ethics & Bias Mitigation Mathematics',
      'AI',
      'Mathematical definitions of demographic parity, equalized odds, counterfactual fairness, and adversarial debiasing optimization.',
      40,
      180,
      'Hard',
      'General Instructions:
1. This exam contains 60 questions across 3 sections.
